# Kafka Rules

- Every event payload must be versioned JSON
- Partition by aggregate id (payment_id)
- Retry topic: `{topic}.retry`, DLQ: `{topic}.dlq`
- Use shared/kafka Producer and Consumer abstractions
- Consumers must be idempotent
